<title>FRANCE: FRENCH JULY OFFICIAL RESERVES 331.65 BLN FFR.</title>
<headline>FRENCH JULY OFFICIAL RESERVES 331.65 BLN FFR.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France and finance ministry gave the following breakdown of offical gold and foreign exchange reserves (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>					  July   June</p>
<p> Total reserves		   331.648  331.463</p>
<p> Gold				 162.460  162.460</p>
<p> Ecu				   56.877   55.296</p>
<p> Foreign exchange		  92.240   93.612</p>
<p> Credits with IMF		  20.071   20.095</p>
